 ],
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The scanner warms before the room does",
   "bar": 1,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse1"
  },
  {
   "text": "The chair still holds the last one's heat",
   "bar": 3,
   "beat": 6.5,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nine miles of gravel on the whiteboard",
   "bar": 5,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Three of them are named for men",
   "bar": 6,
   "beat": 6.5,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse1"
  },
  {
   "text": "I know this county by its mailboxes",
   "bar": 8,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse1"
  },
  {
   "text": "by which dogs are out, by which bridge floods",
   "bar": 10,
   "beat": 6.5,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse1"
  },
  {
   "text": "I have worked here nineteen winters",
   "bar": 11,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse1"
  },
  {
   "text": "I have never once been to a scene",
   "bar": 13,
   "beat": 6.5,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse1"
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a half second after the tone",
   "bar": 15,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 5,
   "section": "pre"
  },
  {
   "text": "where nobody has said anything yet",
   "bar": 17,
   "beat": 4.5,
   "duration": 5,
   "section": "pre"
  },
  {
   "text": "and the whole thing could still be a wrong number",
   "bar": 19,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 5,
   "section": "pre"
  },
  {
   "text": "a kid, a fax machine, a bad connect",
   "bar": 21,
   "beat": 4.5,
   "duration": 5,
   "section": "pre"
  },
  {
   "text": "So say the road. Say it slow",
   "bar": 23,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus"
  },
  {
   "text": "I will find you on line five",
   "bar": 25,
   "beat": 3.5,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus"
  },
  {
   "text": "I will put my voice inside your ear",
   "bar": 27,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus"
  },
  {
   "text": "and hold it there while you drive",
   "bar": 29,
   "beat": 3.5,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus"
  },
  {
   "text": "I don't get to go",
   "bar": 31,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus"
  },
  {
   "text": "I don't get to see how it went",
   "bar": 33,
   "beat": 3.5,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus"
  },
  {
   "text": "I hang up and I wipe the screen clear",
   "bar": 35,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus"
  },
  {
   "text": "and the console clears. Next one sent",
   "bar": 37,
   "beat": 3.5,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus"
  },
  {
   "text": "Tonight it is County Road 6",
   "bar": 39,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse2"
  },
  {
   "text": "the Vaughn place, past the second cattle guard",
   "bar": 41,
   "beat": 6.5,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse2"
  },
  {
   "text": "I have driven by that mailbox",
   "bar": 43,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse2"
  },
  {
   "text": "maybe four thousand times",
   "bar": 44,
   "beat": 6.5,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse2"
  },
  {
   "text": "His wife is on the line and she is not crying",
   "bar": 46,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse2"
  },
  {
   "text": "which is the part that nobody warns you of",
   "bar": 48,
   "beat": 6.5,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse2"
  },
  {
   "text": "how the calm ones are the worst ones",
   "bar": 49,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse2"
  },
  {
   "text": "how they read the address like a receipt",
   "bar": 51,
   "beat": 6.5,
   "duration": 7,
   "section": "verse2"
  },
  {
   "text": "Delacroix says you cannot carry them",
   "bar": 53,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 6,
   "section": "bridge"
  },
  {
   "text": "Delacroix keeps a boat",
   "bar": 55,
   "beat": 5.5,
   "duration": 6,
   "section": "bridge"
  },
  {
   "text": "Delacroix has never held a line",
   "bar": 57,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 6,
   "section": "bridge"
  },
  {
   "text": "open for eleven minutes",
   "bar": 59,
   "beat": 5.5,
   "duration": 6,
   "section": "bridge"
  },
  {
   "text": "So say the road. Say it slow",
   "bar": 61,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus2"
  },
  {
   "text": "I did find you on line five",
   "bar": 63,
   "beat": 3.5,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus2"
  },
  {
   "text": "I did put my voice inside your ear",
   "bar": 65,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus2"
  },
  {
   "text": "and I held it there. You were alive",
   "bar": 67,
   "beat": 3.5,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus2"
  },
  {
   "text": "I don't get to go",
   "bar": 69,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus2"
  },
  {
   "text": "I don't get to see how it went",
   "bar": 71,
   "beat": 3.5,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus2"
  },
  {
   "text": "I hang up and I wipe the screen clear",
   "bar": 73,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus2"
  },
  {
   "text": "and the console clears. Nothing sent",
   "bar": 75,
   "beat": 3.5,
   "duration": 4,
   "section": "chorus2"
  },
  {
   "text": "The pot is down to tar",
   "bar": 77,
   "beat": 1,
   "duration": 3,
   "section": "outro"
  }
 ]
